  "description": "Flash Code is a unique and exciting coding challenge hosted by DotSlash, IIIT Nagpur , designed to test participants in a fun, fast, and competitive way. Unlike traditional contests, Flash Code will feature 3 surprise mini coding games , revealed only on the event day. Each game will have its own winners, runner-ups, and second runner-ups giving everyone multiple chances to shine! Prize pool of INR 35,000 to be distributed among all winners! Participation is individual-only , making it a fair and thrilling competition for all coders What We’re Looking For : Quick thinkers who can adapt to surprise challenges Coders with speed, accuracy, and creativity Individuals ready to compete solo under pressure Enthusiasts eager for a fun, fast-paced coding experience Rules and Key Points : Individual participation only Only 1st and 2nd year students pursuing a B.E./B.Tech. degree are allowed 3 surprise mini coding games revealed on event day Total 9 winners, for a 35K prize pool Separate winners, runner-ups, and 2nd runner-ups for each game Focus on speed, adaptability, and creativity Goodies, prizes, and certificates for all winners",
