    "details": "<p><strong>Flash Code</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a unique and exciting coding challenge hosted by </span><strong>DotSlash, IIIT Nagpur</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, designed to test participants in a fun, fast, and competitive way. Unlike traditional contests, Flash Code will feature </span><strong>3 surprise mini coding games</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, revealed only on the event day. Each game will have its own winners, runner-ups, and second runner-ups&nbsp; giving everyone multiple chances to shine!</span></p>\n<p><strong>Prize pool of INR 35,000</strong> to be distributed among all winners!</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Participation is </span><strong>individual-only</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, making it a fair and thrilling competition for all coders</span></p>\n<p><strong>What We&rsquo;re Looking For :&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quick thinkers who can adapt to surprise challenges</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Coders with speed, accuracy, and creativity</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Individuals ready to compete solo under pressure</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enthusiasts eager for a fun, fast-paced coding experience</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules and Key Points :&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Individual</strong> participation only</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Only <strong>1st and 2nd year</strong> students pursuing a B.E./B.Tech. degree are allowed</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>3 surprise mini coding games</strong> revealed on event day</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Total <strong>9 winners, </strong>for a<strong> 35K prize pool</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Separate <strong>winners, runner-ups, and 2nd runner-ups</strong> for each game</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Focus on speed, adaptability, and creativity</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Goodies, prizes, and certificates for all winners<br /></span></li>\n</ul>",
